ars that weren't mine\nAgainst darkness that imposed on me\nAnd I sailed on unknown seas\n\nAnd on the way they asked if I was ok?\nAnd affirmative he said, but without your hand\nSo I walked and continued\n\nAnd in the darkness of darkness\nI found the light in me\nAnd I realized that the strength will be within\nAnd that on the ground comes rebellion\nThat makes you rise from the darkness\n\nAnd in the end\nAll luck would be\nOf conquest made of unknown darkness\nFrom catacombs of inner demons past\nBut in the end, for them, it would be luck\n\nHow did you get there?\nalone","title":"sozinho","title_en":"alone","title_tr":"alone"},{"comments":0,"file":"21f96d62420140cfae616c27265f0088.jpeg","id":"f95cb45f","kind":"image","section":"escrita","text":"Porque n\u00e3o sorris?\nEst\u00e1s infeliz com a tua vida?\nEst\u00e1s magoado?\nO que te falta?\n\nOh s\u00e9rio \u00e9s tanto\nPor perceberes que a vida n\u00e3o \u00e9 justa\nE que nem todos gostam de n\u00f3s\nE que nem sempre rosas ter\u00e1s\n\nEnt\u00e3o \u00e9 isso\nN\u00e3o iremos fingir isso\nPorque na simplicidade percebes\nQue a vida \u00e9 dura\n\nE que todos somos o que somos\nSentimos como sentimos\nVivemos como vivemos\nMas que todos somos os mesmos\n\nSorrir n\u00e3o te define\nN\u00e3o sorrir n\u00e3o te define\nS\u00f3 saber\u00e1s quando fundo mergulhares\nNa profundidade eterna da minha alma\ninterior","text_tr":"Why don't you smile?\nAre you unhappy with your life?\nAre you hurt?\nWhat are you missing?\n\nOh seriously you are so much\nBecause you realize that life isn't fair\nAnd that not everyone likes us\nAnd you won't always have roses\n\nSo that's it\nWe won't fake it\nBecause in simplicity you understand\nThat life is hard\n\nAnd that we are all what we are\nWe feel how we feel\nWe live how we live\nBut we are all the same\n\nSmiling doesn't define you\nNot smiling doesn't define you\nYou will only know when you dive deep\nIn the eternal depths of my soul\ninterior","title":"porque n\u00e3o s